{{Event Header|Event-MaskedBandits.png}}

{{E|Masked Bandits}} is an [[Event]] found exclusively in [[Act 2]]. This Event and {{E|Tomb of Lord Red Mask}} are the only ways to obtain {{R|Red Mask}}.

==Options==
{{Frame|Pay}} {{TS|negative||Lose ALL}} of your {{TS|gold||Gold.}}
<br>
<br>
{{Frame|Fight!}} 
* Starts a combat against [[#Bandits|the three bandits]] ({{M|Pointy}}, {{M|Romeo}}, and {{M|Bear}}). Upon winning, obtain regular card rewards, 25 - 35 [[Gold]], and {{R|Red Mask}}.

